{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Staff of the Twisted Spirit procs on periodic Shadow damage (#12239, #12599, #13336)",
  "contract": [
    "#12239, #12599, #13336: Staff of the Twisted Spirit (proc dummies 202082, 312614, 316614, 320614) never",
    "procced. Every dummy carries Spell.dbc ProcFlags 0 and the world had no spell_proc row, so",
    "SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs skipped it. Tooltip: \"Your periodic Shadow damage\". Flags 262144 (done periodic)",
    "with SchoolMask 32 (Shadow), damage only. No cooldown in any tooltip. spell_proc_chance reads each loaded",
    "entry's chance, which equals the record's ProcChance, and spell_proc_cooldown_ms reads each loaded cooldown.",
    "aura_proc_rate replays the aura's native proc decision, including the roll, 40000 times on one synthetic",
    "event per check. It procs on a periodic Shadow tick (Shadow Word: Pain 589), at the record's chance; it",
    "never procs on a periodic Fire tick (Immolate 348), a landed direct Shadow spell (Shadow Bolt 686), a heal",
    "over time tick (Rejuvenation 774). Before the repair the chance and cooldown lookups fail with 'Spell has no",
    "proc entry' and every rate reads 0, so the discriminating checks fail instead of flaking."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "caster",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 80,
      "allow_regeneration": false
    }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {
      "id": "dummy",
      "owner": "caster",
      "entry": 36,
      "level": 80,
      "health": 1000000,
      "distance": 4
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
